	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Device Hub — control iOS Simulators from Alfred.

Keywords:
  simnew     Create a new simulator (pick device type + iOS version)
  simopen    Boot and focus an existing simulator
  simapp     Launch an installed app on currently booted simulator(s)
  simlink    Open a deep link (configured or typed) on currently booted simulator(s)

Edit the apps_config and deeplinks_config workflow variables (the {}/Variables
tab in this workflow's editor) to configure your own apps and deep links.

This workflow updates itself via Alfred's built-in GitHub updater — Alfred
checks this repo's releases automatically.</string>
